# LEGACY HTTP mock: pitches/startAt. Not compatible with the new frontend.
# Use packages/contracts/frontend-openapi.yaml and docs/FRONTEND_HANDOFF.md for the future backend.
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:3001/api/v1
@venueId = 200000000000000000000005
@pitchId = 00000000000000000000000a
# Change these to tomorrow in Asia/Ho_Chi_Minh before running.
@date = 2026-11-09
@startAt = 2026-11-09T18:00:00+07:00

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Login (VS Code REST Client named request)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"player@keosan.demo","password":"Demo@12345"}

### Profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### Venue catalog: type and maxPrice must match the same child pitch
GET {{baseUrl}}/venues?type=5&maxPrice=300000&sort=minPrice,name&page=1&limit=6

### Ha Dong: 2 pitches for 5 players and 1 pitch for 11 players
GET {{baseUrl}}/venues/{{venueId}}

### Separate physical pitches in this facility
GET {{baseUrl}}/venues/{{venueId}}/pitches?sort=name&page=1&limit=6

### Alternative flat pitch collection, scoped by venueId
GET {{baseUrl}}/pitches?venueId={{venueId}}&type=5&sort=price,name&page=1&limit=6

### Detail (response includes ETag)
GET {{baseUrl}}/pitches/{{pitchId}}

### Availability
GET {{baseUrl}}/pitches/{{pitchId}}/availability?date={{date}}

### Create; use the same key/body to test replay, a new key for a new intended booking
# @name booking
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-booking-request-001

{
  "pitchId":"{{pitchId}}",
  "startAt":"{{startAt}}",
  "contactName":"Khách demo",
  "contactPhone":"0900000000",
  "note":"Dữ liệu thử nghiệm"
}

### Booking feed; copy nextCursor/links.next to request the next page
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings?status=confirmed&limit=6
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### Read created booking
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings/{{booking.response.body.$.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### Idempotent cancellation: first 201, identical repeat 200
PUT {{baseUrl}}/bookings/{{booking.response.body.$.data.id}}/cancellation
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"reason":"Đội thay đổi kế hoạch"}

### Owner login
# @name owner
POST {{baseUrl}}/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"owner@keosan.demo","password":"Demo@12345"}

### Private owner venue catalog
GET {{baseUrl}}/venues?scope=mine&limit=50
Authorization: Bearer {{owner.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### Private children including inactive pitches; ownership checked on the venue
GET {{baseUrl}}/venues/{{venueId}}/pitches?scope=mine&limit=50
Authorization: Bearer {{owner.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### Read latest version before update
# @name pitch
GET {{baseUrl}}/pitches/{{pitchId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{owner.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### Partial update with optimistic concurrency
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/pitches/{{pitchId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{owner.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
If-Match: {{pitch.response.headers.ETag}}

{"price":360000}

### Invalid query: 400 problem+json
GET {{baseUrl}}/pitches?sort=password

### Missing authentication: 401 + WWW-Authenticate
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings

### Logout: 204, no response body
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/sessions/current
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
